# 35. Profile Trust Model

## Personal

Moderate trust.

May access selected personal context.

Limited external action.

## Research

Low trust.

Untrusted web content expected.

Minimal private data.

No privileged credentials.

## Automation

Medium trust.

API-specific credentials only.

Restricted filesystem.

## High-risk

Very low trust.

Strong isolation.

No personal data.

No unrestricted credentials.

Human approval.

