# 42. Scheduled Job Safety

Every autonomous scheduled task must have:

* maximum runtime
* maximum frequency
* max tool calls
* max tokens
* allowed tools
* allowed domains
* allowed credentials
* cost budget
* output limits
* failure handling
* kill switch
* external monitoring

A looping scheduled job is considered a high-probability operational failure.

